CM_ SG_ 321 torque_request "RAM FFF8B462; read/inferred; Driver torque request after the external limit (AEA6) x AEA0 (=1.0 stock): 10000 + 10 x Nm; with the pedal released: 10000 - 10 x friction (B46C)";
