CM_ SG_ 321 below_rev_limit "RAM FFF888A2 b2; inferred; rpm < AED4 + cal 0x3552C and (rpm < A62E x 128 + cal 0x3552E or A63D b0 clear)";
CM_ SG_ 321 torque_flag_A63Db0 "RAM FFF8A63D b0; unknown; Torque module 0x0BE694 status bit";
CM_ SG_ 321 drive_mode_applied "RAM FFF8A8AB b0-2 <- FFF8A8C3; read; SI-Drive mode applied (A8C3): mode1 (default) -> b1b0=11, mode2 (Sport) -> b0, mode3 (Intelligent) -> b1, mode4 (Sport Sharp) -> b2; positions inferred from the stock maps (Phase 22)";
